UNIT ringAppend
KIND FUNCTIONAL
FIDELITY spec
SIG ringAppend(items, gate) -> Promise<Array>
# Appends through a single circulating permission — only the token-holder acts.
RING token circulates in index order; one schedule per token order
INVARIANT R_ring subset of R_free — a ring may DROP outcomes, never INVENT one
INVARIANT this ring is an IMPOSED refinement, not a recognition: the free unit is
INVARIANT   order-racy, so the ring deliberately narrows 6 outcomes to 1 (n=3)
